@@ -21,6 +21,17 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape
+
+Creates or refreshes a landscape report, aggregating the repository analyses found under an analysis root:
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; creates `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the landscape report (`index.html`)
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command under its original name, kept so existing scripts keep working
+
+Both accept the same options (`-analysisRoot`, `-recursive`, `-confFile`, `-setName`, `-setDescription`, `-setLogoLink`, `-addLink`, `-date`, `-timeout`). Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for details.
+
